{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a8d3d23f00e0a7d3d05df071fcb0129eb4c862edb7579f8778035f91d2c99950", "ja": "（莉緒に渡したいものがあるので連絡したところ、\n『更衣室にいる』と返事がきた。早速行ってみよう！）", "zh": "（因为有东西想交给莉绪，所以联系了她，她回复说“我在更衣室”。那就马上过去吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "1ec5ede015493391623e5df3dd72923769ded54bf2e944612cee3247ee183635", "ja": "{$P$}くん、お疲れ様！\nどうしたの？　私に何か用事？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n怎么了？找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8b9e2aa1701adc3b6ca7c78510bf2d1434cbeb99d2e9b05fdf80896da976091a", "ja": "莉緒に仕事の資料を渡そうと思ったんだ……。\nごめん、メイク中だったか。", "zh": "我本来想把工作的资料交给莉绪……抱歉，你刚才在化妆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "55b9a243845bded187560da97135824c246552062c8d861d72210afdf3e0c86b", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫。実は……これからこのみ姉さんと\n飲み会なの♪　とってもオシャレなお店なんですって！", "zh": "嗯，没关系。其实……我接下来要和好美姐去参加聚会♪ 听说是家特别时髦的店呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98ef3d2e7014c1b387613261ef775499d92a4d0673c23a480d3d5826af71ee58", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。\nそれでいつもより念入りに、ってとこか。", "zh": "啊，原来如此。\n所以才比平时更加仔细啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "5eda08eff9babc63f709463ec58b5ddacc7c4a6e6f8cf8b4b64f3b89db2f6b9a", "ja": "そういうコト♪　でも念入りなのは服もなんだけど……\nどう？　いつもと違うワ・タ・シ♪", "zh": "就是这样♪不过，不只是衣服准备得更仔细……\n怎么样？和平时不一样的我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1ae7c41456f0d4cec54a0e340fa6dc6a4f5a98ed3ce2d8679af6c74fe34e3f83", "ja": "いいと思うよ。オトナっぽい中に、ちゃんと可愛さも\nあって、さすが莉緒って感じのコーディネートだな！", "zh": "我觉得很好啊。成熟之中也保留了恰到好处的可爱，真不愧是莉绪，搭配得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "b9931fc5e41333c42f3ee5a0888457109a02193145eca17f3fc15eb14daa2f8e", "ja": "や、やだ、{$P$}くんったら！\n褒めるのが上手くなってきたじゃな～い！", "zh": "讨、讨厌，{$P$}真是的！越来越会夸人了嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "4ad9640b7ba10bbed02fceb3aec40042d9564d4b61b8a0f076db5f63ebfc756c", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}くんも一緒に行かない？\n私たち二人で、どんな悩みも聞いてア・ゲ・ル♪", "zh": "啊！{$P$}也一起去怎么样？\n我们两个人，什么烦恼都听・你・说哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f66db73267c20ac6936f4dc94b010a935cfea4afcb26f929c892954b7be0e7d2", "ja": "いいのか？　ちょうど息抜きしたい気分でさ。\nまだ仕事があるから、少し遅れるけど……。", "zh": "这样真的好吗？我正好想放松一下。\n因为还有工作要做，所以会晚一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "5683dfe30f2ca0a4355c7c2abf36cd7328bfb259f6f6ca581d6cf66e06731f0d", "ja": "えっ、ウソ！？　無理しなくてもいいんだけど……。\nほ……本当に、来るの？", "zh": "诶，骗人的吧！？其实不用勉强自己的……\n真……真的要来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3ad2df60c1b8492a5973b0c7b4fdb1d0d99ef39be5c412cc3e025043b7aa9081", "ja": "ああ。言ったろ？　息抜きしたかったって。\nというか、何をそんなに驚いてるんだ？", "zh": "啊，我不是说过嘛？想放松一下。\n话说回来，你干吗这么惊讶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "0e557052c22acf726356e16551683c3b365591a216b6bd38b3d822772495f02c", "ja": "それは……絶対断られるんだろうなーと思ってて。\nそ、そっか……来ちゃうのね。う～ん……。", "zh": "因为……我以为你肯定会拒绝的。\n这、这样啊……你真的要来啊。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3264ed55045a083fe0324f87a75a7708d76e9d3e21849162359d6fab53dab462", "ja": "あー……。\nそんなに悩むなら、やっぱり遠慮して……。", "zh": "啊……  \n既然这么纠结，还是算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "d90cbe784c3a55371039394cf9dfd7cc7fc5c7796ae998a88c4b04c2c7914c06", "ja": "だ、大丈夫！　このみ姉さんも喜んでくれるわ！\n私は……ちょっと心の整理ができてないだけで。", "zh": "没、没关系！木实姐也一定会高兴的！\n我……只是心里还有点没理顺而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "187d3d29253b1f25c90d1e34a0858ccb2210977cb069420d77396c15432f8d86", "ja": "な、なんだか色々気になってきちゃった……。\nね、ねえ！　今日の私、変なところないわよね！？", "zh": "不、不知怎么的，开始在意起各种事情来了……\n那、那个！我今天没什么奇怪的地方吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dfb8e0d6a5534eb02416d95c014ff43f486fad9e65cac651382ba15bad2d7622", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。髪型もメイクも服もマッチしてて、\nよく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "啊，当然了。发型、妆容和服装都很搭，\n非常适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "849b00ce28e21e0ddf061be85b25a7185dec2955fba879bed822404b25a127f2", "ja": "うう～。{$P$}くんってば……。\n今日、すごい褒めてくるじゃない！", "zh": "呜呜～，{$P$}真是的……\n今天也太会夸人了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "1a42404145e060f38817ce689bdff2b16edc1509a465ee9978c443bf40a4d4e7", "ja": "そんなに真っ直ぐな目で言われると……私……。", "zh": "被这样直率地盯着夸……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4cead43c2fbd646c20e56026b5a3f5fc53d01dae57103d8b9e864ef197f2a3b0", "ja": "莉緒？　どうした？", "zh": "莉绪？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "1955a923b8e9fbeb00d3d5e5e10074e89ad091e8319940b68042860dbaa75c6b", "ja": "……な、なんでもない！　とにかく、\nお店の場所は、後でこのみ姉さんに連絡してもらうわ。", "zh": "……没、没什么！总之，\n店址晚点我会让KONOMI姐联络你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "588a9cb780e9629d276b916c12a79add70007f1295f980723a918f3930430939", "ja": "キミの仕事のことはわかってるつもりだけど……\n「やっぱり行けない！」とか言わないでね？", "zh": "我自认为了解你的工作……不过，你可别说什么“果然还是去不了了！”之类的话哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1846472af56cd39bdd05c0e73888f5617d4aa49c8a62cdf8e432bb84c834fb71", "ja": "絶対言わない……とは言い切れないが。\n余程のことがない限り、合流するつもりだよ。", "zh": "我也不能把话说死，说绝对不会……不过，只要没有什么特别严重的事，我会和你们汇合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "6e59441220dbbb63fcfe65882e6a15451136ca78fd4de412a2a741df2aff0c47", "ja": "ええ、約束よ？　……私は、もうちょっと\nメイクを直していくわ。お仕事、頑張ってね。ふふ♪", "zh": "嗯，说好了哦？……我再补一下妆。\n工作加油哦。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0354_1024_p", "source_sha256": "da500348589caf978dd80062bdb59922913d4c7053edfbd4a8b4127569a65efe", "ja": "（気合いの入った莉緒とこのみさんとの飲み会か……。\n今日は仕事もプライベートも心して臨まないと！）", "zh": "（和干劲十足的莉绪和木实小姐一起喝酒吗……。\n今天无论是工作还是私生活，我都得打起十二分精神来面对才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
